{"findings":[{"rule_id":"DM-002","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D4","page":1,"quote":"0.5 x 45°"},{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D8","page":1,"quote":"0.5 x 45°"}],"comment":"Dimensions D4 (DETAIL B) and D8 (SECTION A-A) both call out '0.5 x 45°' for chamfers on different features of the same part, which over-dimensions the chamfer size if they refer to the same edge shown in two views, or duplicates the specification unnecessarily. The designer should verify whether these are the same chamfer seen in two views and remove one, or clarify that they apply to distinct edges."
    ,
    "recommended_correction": "Remove the duplicate chamfer dimension if D4 and D8 define the same feature, or add a note clarifying they apply to separate chamfers."}]}
